  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {意見|いけん}が{食|く}い{違|ちが}う: opinions differ\n- {証言|しょうげん}が{食|く}い{違|ちが}う: testimonies conflict\n- {話|はなし}が{食|く}い{違|ちが}う: stories don't match\n- {事実|じじつ}と{食|く}い{違|ちが}う: to conflict with the facts\n\nRELATED NOUN:\n- {食|く}い{違|ちが}い: discrepancy, disagreement\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {異|こと}なる: to differ (more neutral, less confrontational)\n- {矛盾|むじゅん}する: to contradict (stronger; implies logical impossibility)",
